WEBVTT

00:14:58.912 --> 00:15:00.188
and there are students.

00:15:00.212 --> 00:15:06.681
And in that case, the camera is used
to make sure the students are in the room.

00:15:06.705 --> 00:15:08.573
Who's sitting in which seat,

00:15:08.597 --> 00:15:10.197
who might be missing,

00:15:10.221 --> 00:15:13.553
and attendance no longer
needs to be taken,

00:15:13.577 --> 00:15:17.418
people want to go to the bathroom,
they just go, because the system knows.

00:15:17.442 --> 00:15:19.053
And certainly,

00:15:19.077 --> 00:15:23.672
it can also be used to just check
the progress of each student.

00:15:23.696 --> 00:15:28.141
So the teacher knows, this student
seems to have been sleeping,

00:15:28.165 --> 00:15:30.403
or lost or inattentive.